{
  "image_url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:NLC892-411999017142-12361_二十四史_第247冊.pdf",
  "pdf_sha256": "e3ad4b55d152c0299f50ff6b49b8e912825940e00f63760267bef28ab1467932",
  "raw_path": "source-evidence/nan023-wangdan-wyd/columns.tsv",
  "columns": [
    {
      "column": "2L08",
      "location": {
        "pdf_page": 2,
        "half": "左",
        "column_from_right": 8
      },
      "text": "王誕字茂世太保弘從祖兄也祖恬晉中軍將軍父混",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 21
    },
    {
      "column": "2L09",
      "location": {
        "pdf_page": 2,
        "half": "左",
        "column_from_right": 9
      },
      "text": "太常卿誕少有才藻晉孝武帝崩從叔尚書令珣為哀",
      "start_codepoint": 21,
      "end_codepoint": 42
    },
    {
      "column": "2L10",
      "location": {
        "pdf_page": 2,
        "half": "左",
        "column_from_right": 10
      },
      "text": "策出本示誕曰猶恨少序節物誕攬筆便益之接其秋",
      "start_codepoint": 42,
      "end_codepoint": 63
    },
    {
      "column": "3R01",
      "location": {
        "pdf_page": 3,
        "half": "右",
        "column_from_right": 1
      },
      "text": "冬代變後云霜繁廣除風回高殿珣歎美因而用之襲",
      "start_codepoint": 63,
      "end_codepoint": 84
    },
    {
      "column": "3R02",
      "location": {
        "pdf_page": 3,
        "half": "右",
        "column_from_right": 2
      },
      "text": "爵雉鄉侯為會稽王世子元顯後軍長史琅邪內史誕",
      "start_codepoint": 84,
      "end_codepoint": 105
    },
    {
      "column": "3R03",
      "location": {
        "pdf_page": 3,
        "half": "右",
        "column_from_right": 3
      },
      "text": "結事元顯嬖人張法順故見寵元顯納妾誕為之親迎",
      "start_codepoint": 105,
      "end_codepoint": 126
    },
    {
      "column": "3R04",
      "location": {
        "pdf_page": 3,
        "half": "右",
        "column_from_right": 4
      },
      "text": "隨府轉驃騎長史內史如故元顯討桓𤣥欲悉誅諸桓",
      "start_codepoint": 126,
      "end_codepoint": 147
    },
    {
      "column": "3R05",
      "location": {
        "pdf_page": 3,
        "half": "右",
        "column_from_right": 5
      },
      "text": "誕救桓修等由此得免修誕甥也及𤣥得志將見誅修",
      "start_codepoint": 147,
      "end_codepoint": 168
    },
    {
      "column": "3R06",
      "location": {
        "pdf_page": 3,
        "half": "右",
        "column_from_right": 6
      },
      "text": "為陳請乃徙廣州盧循據廣州以誕為其平南府長史",
      "start_codepoint": 168,
      "end_codepoint": 189
    },
    {
      "column": "3R07",
      "location": {
        "pdf_page": 3,
        "half": "右",
        "column_from_right": 7
      },
      "text": "甚賓禮之誕久客思歸乃説循曰下官與劉鎮軍情味",
      "start_codepoint": 189,
      "end_codepoint": 210
    },
    {
      "column": "3R08",
      "location": {
        "pdf_page": 3,
        "half": "右",
        "column_from_right": 8
      },
      "text": "不淺若得北歸必蒙任寄時廣州刺史吳隱之亦為循",
      "start_codepoint": 210,
      "end_codepoint": 231
    },
    {
      "column": "3R09",
      "location": {
        "pdf_page": 3,
        "half": "右",
        "column_from_right": 9
      },
      "text": "所拘留誕又曰將軍今留吳公公私非計孫伯符豈不",
      "start_codepoint": 231,
      "end_codepoint": 252
    },
    {
      "column": "3R10",
      "location": {
        "pdf_page": 3,
        "half": "右",
        "column_from_right": 10
      },
      "text": "欲留華子魚但以一境不容二君耳於是誕及隱之俱",
      "start_codepoint": 252,
      "end_codepoint": 273
    },
    {
      "column": "3L01",
      "location": {
        "pdf_page": 3,
        "half": "左",
        "column_from_right": 1
      },
      "text": "得還誕為宋武帝太尉長史盡心歸奉帝甚仗之盧循",
      "start_codepoint": 273,
      "end_codepoint": 294
    },
    {
      "column": "3L02",
      "location": {
        "pdf_page": 3,
        "half": "左",
        "column_from_right": 2
      },
      "text": "自蔡洲南走劉毅固求追討誕密白帝曰公既平廣固",
      "start_codepoint": 294,
      "end_codepoint": 315
    },
    {
      "column": "3L03",
      "location": {
        "pdf_page": 3,
        "half": "左",
        "column_from_right": 3
      },
      "text": "復滅盧循則功蓋終古勳無與二如此大威豈可使餘",
      "start_codepoint": 315,
      "end_codepoint": 336
    },
    {
      "column": "3L04",
      "location": {
        "pdf_page": 3,
        "half": "左",
        "column_from_right": 4
      },
      "text": "人分之毅與公同起布衣一時相推耳今既喪敗不宜",
      "start_codepoint": 336,
      "end_codepoint": 357
    },
    {
      "column": "3L05",
      "location": {
        "pdf_page": 3,
        "half": "左",
        "column_from_right": 5
      },
      "text": "復使立功帝納其説後為吳國內史母憂去職武帝伐",
      "start_codepoint": 357,
      "end_codepoint": 378
    },
    {
      "column": "3L06",
      "location": {
        "pdf_page": 3,
        "half": "左",
        "column_from_right": 6
      },
      "text": "劉毅起為輔國將軍誕固辭以墨絰從行時諸葛長人",
      "start_codepoint": 378,
      "end_codepoint": 399
    },
    {
      "column": "3L07",
      "location": {
        "pdf_page": 3,
        "half": "左",
        "column_from_right": 7
      },
      "text": "行太尉留府事心不自安武帝甚慮之毅既平誕求先",
      "start_codepoint": 399,
      "end_codepoint": 420
    },
    {
      "column": "3L08",
      "location": {
        "pdf_page": 3,
        "half": "左",
        "column_from_right": 8
      },
      "text": "下帝曰長人似有自疑心卿詎宜便去誕曰長人知下",
      "start_codepoint": 420,
      "end_codepoint": 441
    },
    {
      "column": "3L09",
      "location": {
        "pdf_page": 3,
        "half": "左",
        "column_from_right": 9
      },
      "text": "官蒙公垂盼今輕身單下必當以為無虞可少安其意",
      "start_codepoint": 441,
      "end_codepoint": 462
    },
    {
      "column": "3L10",
      "location": {
        "pdf_page": 3,
        "half": "左",
        "column_from_right": 10
      },
      "text": "帝笑曰卿勇過賁育矣於是先還後卒追封作唐縣五",
      "start_codepoint": 462,
      "end_codepoint": 483
    },
    {
      "column": "4R01",
      "location": {
        "pdf_page": 4,
        "half": "右",
        "column_from_right": 1
      },
      "text": "等侯子詡早卒誕兄嘏字偉世侍中左戸尚書始興公",
      "start_codepoint": 483,
      "end_codepoint": 504
    },
    {
      "column": "4R02",
      "location": {
        "pdf_page": 4,
        "half": "右",
        "column_from_right": 2
      },
      "text": "嘏子偃",
      "start_codepoint": 504,
      "end_codepoint": 507
    },
    {
      "column": "4R03",
      "location": {
        "pdf_page": 4,
        "half": "右",
        "column_from_right": 3
      },
      "text": "偃字子游母晉孝武帝女鄱陽公主宋受禪封永成君",
      "start_codepoint": 507,
      "end_codepoint": 528
    },
    {
      "column": "4R04",
      "location": {
        "pdf_page": 4,
        "half": "右",
        "column_from_right": 4
      },
      "text": "偃尚宋武帝第二女吳興長公主諱榮男常裸偃縛諸",
      "start_codepoint": 528,
      "end_codepoint": 549
    },
    {
      "column": "4R05",
      "location": {
        "pdf_page": 4,
        "half": "右",
        "column_from_right": 5
      },
      "text": "庭樹時天夜雪噤凍久之偃兄恢排閣詬主乃免偃謙",
      "start_codepoint": 549,
      "end_codepoint": 570
    },
    {
      "column": "4R06",
      "location": {
        "pdf_page": 4,
        "half": "右",
        "column_from_right": 6
      },
      "text": "虛恭謹不以世事關懷位右光祿大夫贈開府儀同三",
      "start_codepoint": 570,
      "end_codepoint": 591
    },
    {
      "column": "4R07",
      "location": {
        "pdf_page": 4,
        "half": "右",
        "column_from_right": 7
      },
      "text": "司諡恭公",
      "start_codepoint": 591,
      "end_codepoint": 595
    }
  ],
  "scope": "卷二十三王誕、嘏與偃三單元，未收右7末以下藻傳。",
  "digital_chapter_id": "c-nanshi-023-wangdan-gu-yan",
